      "name": "updatedAt-same-second-falls-to-the-greater-id",
      "note": "05.000 (the app's seconds) and 05.999 (the server's milliseconds) are one second, so the id decides. 'alpha' is greater than 'Zulu' by code units (0x61 > 0x5A), though localeCompare and the milliseconds would both pick 'Zulu'.",
